🔥 INTERVIEW PREPARATION HIGHLIGHTS
===============================================================================

⭐ **Must-Know Problems for Interviews:**
1. **Reverse a Linked List** (Problem 17) - Asked in 90% of interviews
2. **Detect Cycle** (Problem 19) - Classic algorithm question
3. **Find Middle Element** (Problem 18) - Two-pointer technique
4. **Delete by Value** (Problem 13) - Careful pointer manipulation

⭐ **Common Pitfalls to Avoid:**
□ Null pointer exceptions (always check node != null)
□ Losing track of previous node during deletion
□ Not updating head pointer when needed
□ Off-by-one errors in position-based operations
□ Infinite loops due to improper pointer updates

⭐ **Time Complexities to Remember:**
□ Search: O(n) - must traverse sequentially
□ Insert at beginning: O(1) - direct head manipulation
□ Insert at end: O(n) - must traverse to end
□ Delete: O(n) - must find element first
□ Reverse: O(n) - single pass through list

